# RECORDED DATA NEVER LEAVES THIS MACHINE.
#
# captures/ holds the owner's EEG. This is first in the file for the same reason it
# is first in the constitution. This repository is destined to be open-sourced
# as the GUI half of the IntoMind stack, and a person's neural recordings do
# not go out with the software that happened to write them.
#
# The recordings still LIVE here, beside the analyses that formatted them and
# read them back. They are simply not this repository's content: the repository
# is for the software. Untracked on 2026-08-19, at the owner's instruction.
captures/
*.npz
*.meta.json
*.events.json
*.inputs.npz
*.sha256
SESSIONS.jsonl

__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Derived from captures/, regenerable. The record is captures/<label>.npz.
exports/

# Machine map and internal-name list stay local.
tests/internal-names.txt
